# tend root for locate run `{{run_id}}` — preset `{{preset}}`

Generated by `cf plan-locate`. Do not hand-edit: regenerate instead, so `run.yaml` keeps
recording the prompt shas that were actually used.

| | |
|---|---|
| entrypoint | `{{entrypoint}}` |
| gate (out of tree) | `{{gate_dir}}/{{gate_script}} --gate-config {{gate_dir}}/gate.json` |
| task manifests | `{{gate_dir}}/tasks/<task-id>.json` |
| sourceset | `{{sourceset_pin}}` |
| universe | `{{universe_pin}}` |
| bridge | `{{bridge}}` |
| model | `{{model}}` |
| tasks | {{task_count}} |
| concurrency | {{max_workers}} workers / {{max_reviewers}} reviewers |

`gate/` holds the locate gate and the findings gate it imports, its task manifests, the
head-text helper `locate_text.py`, the record builder `locate_records.py`, the passage-id tool,
the two read-only corpus tools and `vendor/` with both vendored packages; it is outside every
worktree, and a worker can run its tools but not change them. `bin/` holds the bridge and every
helper it calls (`agent_call.py`, `attempt_cap.py`, `watchdog.py` among them). Each task writes
`findings/<task-id>/<source-id>.json` for the sources its manifest names, and nothing else.

The worker reads `CF_EXTRA_TOOLS` (the corpus tools' allowlist entries, each pinned to the run's
tools database with `--db`, which the tools also enforce against `gate/gate.json`),
`CF_TASK_MANIFESTS`, `CF_ATTEMPT_CAP`, `CF_MERGE_TARGET` and `CF_FINDINGS_GLOB` from its wrapper
in `bin/`; the reviewer's wrapper adds the gate to its allowlist (`CF_REVIEWER_TOOLS`). tend's
validation command runs the gate with `--changed-files`, its pre-merge command adds `--pre-merge`
(a batch of several tasks). Every gate call writes a line to `gate-log/gate.jsonl`; the watchdog and
the bench count only the `changed_files: true` lines, tend's own calls. Start with a **1/1 smoke
test** and watch one task through worker → gate → reviewer → merge before raising the limits:

```bash
uv run tend-control limits --root {{tend_root}} --workers 1 --reviewers 1
uv run tend run --root {{tend_root}} --log-level INFO
# ... one task all the way through ...
uv run tend-control limits --root {{tend_root}} --workers {{max_workers}} --reviewers {{max_reviewers}}
```

Set a budget ceiling before raising concurrency: a locate run is not sent anywhere without one.
